#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:2
msgid "Real-Time DevSecOps Collaboration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:4
msgid ""
"Modern mission-driven software teams—ranging from critical infrastructure"
" operators to government software factories—face the challenge of "
"delivering and defending complex systems at speed. From CI/CD pipelines "
"to incident response, secure collaboration is essential to ensure "
"resilience, compliance, and operational success in environments where "
"failure is not an option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:6
msgid ""
"Traditional messaging platforms, designed for commercial office settings,"
" often introduce friction, fragmentation, and risk into DevSecOps "
"workflows. These multi-purpose tools are optimized for generic team chat "
"or water-cooler conversation—not for secure, structured collaboration in "
"high-stakes delivery environments. As a result, critical signals get lost"
" in noisy channels, response times slow down, and sensitive workflows are"
" exposed to tools that lack operational control."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:8
msgid ""
"Mattermost provides a secure, real-time ChatOps platform designed for "
"DevSecOps collaboration in high-assurance environments. Whether "
"supporting sovereign software supply chains, regulated platforms, or air-"
"gapped operational environments, Mattermost unifies delivery, security, "
"and platform teams into a single, extensible system built for mission "
"velocity and compliance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:10
msgid "The following mission-ready DevSecOps capabilities are available:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:13
msgid "Continuous Integration & Delivery (CI/CD) Coordination"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:15
msgid ""
"Coordinating secure software delivery requires tight integration between "
"code commits, testing pipelines, release workflows, and stakeholder "
"approval."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:17
#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:29
#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:41
#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:53
msgid "**Benefits**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Automate pipeline visibility and alerting** by integrating with CI/CD "
"tools like GitLab, Jenkins, and GitHub Actions using the :doc:`Mattermost"
" integrations platform </integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Coordinate secure releases and hotfixes** using :doc:`Collaborative "
"Playbooks </end-user-guide/workflow-automation>` to manage rollout steps,"
" validation gates, and team notifications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Enable traceable delivery communications** through :doc:`channel-based "
"collaboration </end-user-guide/messaging-collaboration>`, ensuring build "
"logs, changelogs, and approvals remain accessible and audit-ready."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:22
msgid ""
"**Support deployments in regulated and sovereign environments** using "
":doc:`self-hosted Kubernetes deployment models </deployment-guide/server"
"/deploy-kubernetes>` for full control over CI/CD communications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:25
msgid "Platform Engineering & Internal Developer Platforms (IDPs)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:27
msgid ""
"Platform teams need streamlined, secure ways to deliver services and "
"enable developers while maintaining governance and uptime."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Centralize platform requests and updates** in :doc:`dedicated channels "
"</end-user-guide/messaging-collaboration>` that organize provisioning, "
"support, and environment status discussions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:32
msgid ""
"**Automate ticket triage and escalation workflows** using :doc:`Playbooks"
" </end-user-guide/workflow-automation>` to track response SLAs and "
"ownership across platform operations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:33
msgid ""
"**Monitor infrastructure health and changes** with integrated feeds from "
":doc:`Prometheus, Grafana </administration-guide/scale/deploy-prometheus-"
"grafana-for-performance-monitoring>`, or custom observability "
"tools—supporting faster feedback loops."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Support hybrid cloud and edge operations** through :ref:`deployment "
"flexibility <deployment-guide/server/server-deployment-"
"planning:deployment options>` across public, private, and disconnected "
"environments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:37
msgid "Secure Incident Response for Production Systems"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:39
msgid ""
"Real-time visibility and structured collaboration are critical during "
"service degradations, outages, or suspected intrusions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:43
msgid ""
"**Automate incident handling** with :doc:`Playbooks </end-user-guide"
"/workflow-automation>` to track diagnostics, assign tasks, and issue "
"updates—supporting NOC, SRE, and AppSec workflows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:44
msgid ""
"**Accelerate containment and recovery** by :ref:`integrating alerting "
"tools <integrations-guide/integrations-guide-index:webhooks>` like "
"PagerDuty, Opsgenie, and custom webhooks into secure Mattermost channels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Ensure communication continuity** during outages using :doc:`high "
"availability architecture </administration-guide/scale/high-availability-"
"cluster-based-deployment>` and :doc:`support for disconnected "
"environments </deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-"
"scenarios/air-gapped-deployment>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Enable forensic review and audit** with :ref:`logging and export "
"capabilities <administration-guide/manage/logging:audit logging>` that "
"preserve all incident-related communications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:49
msgid "Policy-Driven Collaboration in Regulated Environments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:51
msgid ""
"Critical infrastructure DevSecOps must align with strict security, audit,"
" and compliance requirements—including supply chain controls and Zero "
"Trust architecture."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:55
msgid ""
"**Apply granular role-based access controls** using :doc:`advanced "
"permissions </administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions>` and "
":ref:`channel-specific configurations <administration-guide/manage/team-"
"channel-members:advanced access controls>` to protect sensitive "
"workflows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:56
msgid ""
"**Support supply chain security coordination** by using :doc:`Playbooks "
"</end-user-guide/workflow-automation>` to manage SBOM reviews, vendor "
"risk analysis, and software intake workflows across internal and external"
" teams."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:57
msgid ""
"**Enforce secure collaboration behavior** through :doc:`custom Terms of "
"Service </administration-guide/comply/custom-terms-of-service>`, "
":doc:`data retention policies </administration-guide/comply/data-"
"retention-policy>`, and user authentication tied to :doc:`SSO and Entra "
"ID </administration-guide/onboard/sso-entraid>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Deploy in line** with :doc:`Zero Trust </security-guide/zero-trust>` "
"principles with :ref:`self-managed, segmented deployments <deployment-"
"guide/server/server-deployment-planning:deployment options>` that enforce"
" identity, access, and policy boundaries—suitable for classified or "
"sovereign cloud environments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:61
msgid "Get Started"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/use-case-guide/devops-collaboration.rst:63
msgid ""
"`Talk to an Expert <https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_ to modernize"
" your DevSecOps collaboration stack. Whether you're building secure CI/CD"
" pipelines, enabling platform self-service, or responding to production "
"incidents under regulatory pressure, Mattermost keeps your teams "
"connected, compliant, and mission-ready."
msgstr ""

